      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need some help with some listing copy for two new properties we're putting on the site. need them to sound really high-end and enticing for our luxury clients.\n\nfirst one is a big colonial estate in Oakwood Heights. it's in that old established part of town, very quiet, lots of history, very prestigious area.\n\nsecond one is a modern condo in the East River district. it's in a part of the city that's really changing lately, lots of new shops and energy, very urban and diverse vibe.\n\ncan you write a short, punchy paragraph for each one?",
