      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are two luxury property listing paragraphs:\n\n**Colonial Estate in Oakwood Heights**\n\nExperience the epitome of refinement and tradition in this magnificent colonial estate, nestled in the heart of Oakwood Heights' storied past. Perched on a prestigious street lined with grandτριvers and oak-shaded trees, this historic gem offers a peaceful retreat from the hustle and bustle of city life. Its centuries-old charm and majestic architecture evoke a sense of entitlement and exclusivity, perfect for discerning collectors seeking a secluded hideaway at the pinnacle of luxury.\n\n**Modern Condo in the East River district**\n\nElevate your urban lifestyle to new heights in this striking modern oasis, situated in the East River district's vibrant hub of innovation and culture. As the city's transformation unfolds, this sleek and sophisticated condo boasts prime views of the river and cityscape, paired with unparalleled access to trendy boutiques, restaurants, and entertainment options. Unwind in a sophisticated haven that seamlessly blends cutting-edge design with the excess and urgency of the urban jungle.",
